00:41:14.691 --> 00:41:16.060
Send me a picture.

538
00:41:20.760 --> 00:41:22.276
I'm too embarrassed.

539
00:41:22.277 --> 00:41:24.104
Can't be that bad.

540
00:41:24.105 --> 00:41:25.345
Yeah. it is.

541
00:41:25.346 --> 00:41:27.587
Bruises or cuts?
Both.

542
00:41:27.588 --> 00:41:30.070
If it's cuts you need a surgeon.
A good one.

543
00:41:30.071 --> 00:41:31.414
Do you have a good one?

544
00:41:31.415 --> 00:41:33.139
My uncle does.

545
00:41:33.140 --> 00:41:34.784
Where are you?

546
00:41:37.140 --> 00:41:38.725
I'm in Charlotte.

547
00:41:38.726 --> 00:41:41.070
Where are you?
Atlanta.

548
00:41:41.071 --> 00:41:42.514
We're flying to Chesapeake tomorrow.

549
00:41:42.515 --> 00:41:44.273
Want to meet us?

550
00:41:44.274 --> 00:41:46.239
I promise I won't laugh at your face.

551
00:41:46.240 --> 00:41:49.721
You might.

552
00:41:49.722 --> 00:41:51.514
You have a bathing suit?

553
00:41:51.515 --> 00:41:53.618
I can get one.

554
00:41:53.619 --> 00:41:55.859
Get a small one.
I'm bringing boys.

555
00:41:55.860 --> 00:41:57.652
How small?

556
00:41:57.653 --> 00:42:00.652
Some things are
best left to the imagination.

557
00:42:00.653 --> 00:42:02.608
Your body isn't one of them.

558
00:42:04.415 --> 00:42:08.242
I'll text you the address.
See you tomorrow.

559
00:42:08.243 --> 00:42:11.139
Bye.
Bye.

560
00:42:11.140 --> 00:42:13.139
Fuck.

561
00:42:13.140 --> 00:42:14.646
I need to go shopping.
